    "description": "Physical and sexual assault still remain a huge issue, even in modern society. PartySafe was made in order to help solve this by providing a medium for friends and family to contact their loved ones through a short SOS signal sent through their respective Pebbles. In retrospect, the application can also be used for many other purposes such setting up meeting points at concerts or quick communication.\n\nParty Safe uses Parse as a backend service and integrates an Android application with a Pebble watch. Alerts and location can be sent from users at the touch of a button to notify others of dangers or urgent messages",
